> while optimal adaptation reduces these damages to 3.41 \textsterling billion.
> Storms and relocation contribute the largest share of costs. DIVA results are combined across all impact categories. For each models, we perform a Monte Carlo sampling across with- and without-adaptation results, to capture the range of possible outcomes.
