> 
> Finally, we convert the resulting coastal damages into percentage losses of UK GDP by dividing the annual monetary losses by a no-damage GDP baseline for the corresponding year. Where needed, we harmonise currencies, price levels, and baseline GDP paths to be consistent with the rest of the sectoral impact analysis. Further details of the uncertainty propagation, currency conversion, and model-combination procedures applied across all sectors are provided in \citet{rising2026comprehensive}, and are not repeated here.
