> \subsubsection{CCRA3 risks}
> 
> To translate risk evaluations from the CCRA3 report \citep{watkiss2021monetary} into a distribution of missing risks, we follow these steps:
> \begin{enumerate}
>     \item Quantify the reported range from the CCRA3 report into low and high bounds.
>     \item For impact channels with reported values in \citetalias{watkiss2021monetary}, we record or calculate  an indicative average and standard error. All calculations are available at \url{https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1-XBCUAyxkc70iWVPWNek8Y8OecccmKO546_zJjfc2No/edit?usp=sharing}. This is done for all CCRA3 channels, where only channels not included in the study are used for this missing risks channel, and the overlapping channels are used for comparison.
